  "title": "Vegan Butternut Squash and Lentil Stew in the Slow Cooker",
  "description": "A delicious, nutritious stew that will delight vegans and meat-eaters alike. Everything goes in the slow cooker, and you'll have a delicious meal 3 hours later.",
